# Broker has no host-published port. Run these requests only from an
# authenticated trusted container on the broker control network.

@broker = http://broker:8000
@adminToken = {{broker_admin_token}}

### Liveness
GET {{broker}}/health

### Provision the local dummy value (never use a real upstream key here)
PUT {{broker}}/v1/admin/credentials/github-production
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value":{"api_key":"local-dummy-github-token"}}

# Lease issuance is performed by the Runtime Shield gateway after authorization
# and HITL. Do not call /internal/v1/leases/{id}/redeem from this client.
